    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "common_2130_battle_06",
      "hash64": "3C3C4ABF3B5E480D",
      "text": "Como profesora, me siento en la obligación de\\nguiarte para que sigas mejorando...[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "common_2130_battle_07",
      "hash64": "3C3C49BF3B5E465A",
      "text": "Pero, por otra parte, ¿qué clase de profesora de\\nCombate sería si no fuese capaz de vencerte?[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "common_2130_battle_08",
      "hash64": "3C3C3CBF3B5E3043",
      "text": "Ya lo siento por ti, ¡pero voy a ir a por todas![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 2,
